 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSociété Lumière SARL                                      MASTER SERVICES\n12 Rue de la République, 13001 Marseille, France          AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR15 922496106\n\nFROM                                                     FACTURE À\nSociété Lumière SARL                                     Atelier Provence SAS\n12 Rue de la République                                  45 Avenue Victor Hugo\n13001 Marseille                                          75008 Paris\nFrance                                                   France\nVAT: FR15 922496106                                      PAYÉ [stamped]\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 01/04/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Société Lumière SARL, with its registered office at 12 Rue de la République,\nMarseille (\"Party A\"), and Atelier Provence SAS, with its registered office at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo,\nParis (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n Party A   Société Lumière SARL / Pierre Martin\n Party B   Atelier Provence SAS / Pierre Martin\n Date      01/04/2026",
